# Per-skill eval run artifacts (timestamped transcripts, grading.json,
# benchmark output) — these are reproducible per-laptop and would bloat
# the tree. Test definitions (evals.json, trigger.json) are tracked so
# the eval suite is reproducible across developer laptops + reviewable
# in PRs.
**/evals/runs/
**/evals/feedback.json
**/evals/results.json
**/evals/transcripts/
**/evals/benchmark.*

# Skill iteration workspaces (eval run artifacts)
# Note: matches dirs ending in -workspace/ but NOT the sync-workspace skill itself
**/*-workspace/
!skills/sync-workspace/
